# SaveLoom API

- Auth check: `const session = await auth()` — return 401 if no `session?.user?.id`
- Serialize Prisma Decimals: `parseMoney(field)` before JSON (see `bank-accounts/route.ts`)
- Transaction sign: negative = expense, positive = income
- Dashboard aggregates: implement in `src/app/api/dashboard/stats/route.ts`, not client-side
- AI routes: use `AIInsightsEngine`, handle Anthropic errors with clear messages
- Env: add new vars to `src/env.js` schema and `.env.example`
